#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:4
msgid "v3.9.2"
msgstr "v3.9.2"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.9.2 substantially improves the **TV driver** (higher resolution, scaling,"
" triple buffering), re-enables imlib features that now fit in flash, bumps "
"the ImageIO format version, and fixes the FLIR Lepton driver, F7 LCD triple "
"buffering, and grayscale color/Y filtering. It introduces **no breaking API "
"changes** — v3.9.1 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v3.9.2 značajno poboljšava **TV upravljački program** (veća razlučivost, "
"skaliranje, trostruko međuspremanje), ponovno omogućava imlib značajke koje "
"sada stanu u flash memoriju, podiže verziju ImageIO formata te ispravlja "
"FLIR Lepton upravljački program, F7 LCD trostruko međuspremanje i "
"filtriranje boje/Y za sive tonove. Ne uvodi **nikakve promjene API-ja koje "
"narušavaju kompatibilnost** — v3.9.1 skripte rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:20
msgid "**TV driver** — higher resolution, scaling, and triple buffering."
msgstr ""
"**TV upravljački program** — veća razlučivost, skaliranje i trostruko "
"međuspremanje."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:21
msgid ""
"**More imlib features** re-enabled now that the extra code fits in flash."
msgstr ""
"**Više imlib značajki** ponovno omogućeno sada kada dodatni kod stane u "
"flash memoriju."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Fixes** — FLIR Lepton driver (M4/M7), F7 LCD triple buffering, grayscale "
"color and Y filtering."
msgstr ""
"**Ispravci** — FLIR Lepton upravljački program (M4/M7), F7 LCD trostruko "
"međuspremanje, boja sivih tonova i Y filtriranje."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:24
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v3.9.1 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nema promjena API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — ponovno flashajte "
"i vaše v3.9.1 skripte rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:28
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:30
msgid ""
"**TV driver** — improved resolution, added scaling, and added triple "
"buffering."
msgstr ""
"**TV upravljački program** — poboljšana razlučivost, dodano skaliranje i "
"dodano trostruko međuspremanje."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:32
msgid ""
"Re-enabled imlib features and additional support that now fit in flash."
msgstr ""
"Ponovno omogućene imlib značajke i dodatna podrška koje sada stanu u flash "
"memoriju."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:35
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:37
msgid ""
"Bumped the ImageIO format version; switched to RGB565 when a color table is "
"used and to fast YUV macros; renamed and tidied several examples; enabled SD"
" hardware flow control and used two stop bits for the debug UART connection."
msgstr ""
"Podignuta verzija ImageIO formata; prelazak na RGB565 kada se koristi "
"tablica boja i na brze YUV makroe; preimenovano i uređeno nekoliko primjera;"
" omogućeno SD hardversko upravljanje protokom i korištena dva stop bita za "
"debug UART vezu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:42
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:44
msgid "Camera and display:"
msgstr "Kamera i prikaz:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:46
msgid ""
"Fixed the FLIR Lepton driver on the M4 and M7, F7 LCD triple-buffering "
"issues, grayscale color and the Y filter, and DCMI de-init on sensor "
"shutdown (added DCMI MSP de-init)."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljen FLIR Lepton upravljački program na M4 i M7, problemi s F7 LCD "
"trostrukim međuspremanjem, boja sivih tonova i Y filtar te DCMI "
"deinicijalizacija pri gašenju senzora (dodana DCMI MSP deinicijalizacija)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:50
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Sustav:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:52
msgid "Fixed an issue with an old version of pygame in the desktop tooling."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljen problem sa starom verzijom pygamea u alatima za radnu površinu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:55
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.2.rst:57
msgid ""
"v3.9.2 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v3.9.1 run unchanged on v3.9.2 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v3.9.2 ne uvodi **nikakve promjene Python API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v3.9.1 rade nepromijenjene na"
" v3.9.2 — samo ponovno flashajte ugrađeni program."
